22 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(I, the undersigned, Mohamed TOUATI, CEO & Principal Data Scientist at Pixemantic, hereby certify that Roudayna Kouka, a software engineering student at the Faculty of Sciences of Tunis, holder of National ID card No. 14461333, completed a summer internship within our company from 25/06/2025 to 25/08/2025.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

23 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(31/08/2025)/Pg 9 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

