<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Mission:)/Pg 9 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

25 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E( During her internship, Ms. Kouka participated in the entire full-stack development cycle of an innovative solution for the medical sector. Her main tasks included:)/Pg 9 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

26 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Designing UI/UX interfaces to ensure a smooth and user-friendly experience)/Pg 9 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

27 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Creating the project\220s visual identity, including logo design)/Pg 9 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

28 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Developing both the frontend and backend of the application)/Pg 9 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

29 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Integrating a Deep Learning-based OCR engine for extracting and processing medical data from documents and images)/Pg 9 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

30 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Integrating an intelligent chatbot to assist users in interacting with the platform)/Pg 9 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

31 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(Ms. Roudayna Kouka demonstrated excellent initiative, creativity in UI/UX design, as well as strong proficiency in web technologies. Her full-stack development skills, team spirit, and scientific rigor contributed significantly to the success of the App4Doctors project.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

32 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 14 0 R/E(We acknowledge the quality of her work and her continuous commitment, and we wish her full success in her future studies and professional career.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

